.TH DUB-REMOVE-PATH 1 "2026-08-16" "The D Language Foundation" "The D Language Foundation"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dub-remove-path \- Removes a package search path
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdub remove-path \fR<\fIpath\fR> \fIOPTIONS\&.\&.\&.\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Removes a package search path previously added with add-path.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-system\fR
.RS 4
DEPRECATED: Use --cache=system instead
.RE
.SS COMMON OPTIONS
See \fBdub\fR(1)
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.TP
.BR 0
DUB succeeded
.TP
.BR 1
usage errors, unknown command line flags
.TP
.BR 2
package not found, package failed to load, miscellaneous error
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
\fIdub\&.sdl\fR, \fIdub\&.json\fR
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Copyright (c) 1999-2026 by The D Language Foundation
.SH ONLINE DOCUMENTATION
.URhttp://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
http://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
.UE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBdub\fR(1), \fBdub-add-path\fR(1)
